{"availability":"available","full":"HagAli22/Image-Captain","name":"Image-Captain","description":"Image captioning with custom Transformer decoder comparing ResNet-50 (CNN) vs ViT-B/16 encoders on MS COCO 2017. Achieves 1.07 CIDEr with ViT. Includes beam search, backbone fine-tuning, and a Gradio demo.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-11T06:10:15Z","updated":"2026-02-15T12:47:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mostafahagali/vit-image-captioning","topics":["coco-dataset","computer-vision","deep-learning","encoder-decoder","gradio","image-captioning","natural-language-processing","pytorch","resnet","transformer","vision-transformer","vit"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mostafahagali/vit-image-captioning","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.825Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.825Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.825Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.825Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A deep learning image captioning system that generates natural language descriptions from images using a custom Transformer decoder, trained on the MS COCO 2017 dataset. The project explores and compares two visual encoder architectures — ResNet-50 (CNN) and ViT-B/16 (Vision Transformer) — to study how different image representations affect caption quality.","Try it now: huggingface.co/spaces/mostafahagali/vit-image-captioning","A core goal of this project was to experimentally compare how different visual backbones affect image captioning:"],"features":["Encoder comparison study — trained and evaluated with both ResNet-50 (CNN) and ViT-B/16 to compare how convolutional vs. attention-based visual features impact captioning performance","Custom Transformer blocks — hand-built multi-head attention encoder and decoder layers (not nn.Transformer wrapper)","Beam sear